{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/TIME_ESCAPE_wide_yellow.png?t=1740344321\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Years ago, your mentor and gentleman scientist Dr. A. Priori said that he would one day need your help, and that day has finally arrived. You've received a letter from the Professor asking you to finish what he could not. But finish what? And what are these strange devices?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/TimeEscape_SteamGIFs_explore01.gif?t=1740344321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a whole building and unlock rooms full of mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use time bubbles to change the environment, solve puzzles and unravel the mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/TimeEscape_SteamGIFs_bubble01.gif?t=1740344321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play this first-person puzzle escape room game solo or co-op with up to 4 players.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3143000?t=1740344321","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740344321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/116f207486915e514a99b27215380a8eff5a360e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740344321","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/116f207486915e514a99b27215380a8eff5a360e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740344321","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Supp